# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Only the tooling code is shared on the remote. All game art — source
# style-sheets, snapped/segmented output, parallax strips, deliveries — is
# kept local. The hand-authored atlas_spec.json files are the one exception
# (they are the declarative input to main_tiles.py, not assets).
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Sprite pipeline
/Input_Generated_Character/
/Output_Sprite_Sheet/

# Background / parallax pipeline
/background_image/

# Tile-atlas pipeline: deliveries + every biome art tree
/Deliveries/
/tiles/**
/tiles_done/**
!/tiles/**/
!/tiles_done/**/
!/tiles/**/atlas_spec.json
!/tiles_done/**/atlas_spec.json

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
